                    to the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff. Sonnenfeldt forwarded the text as
                    an attachment to a December 18 memorandum to Kissinger; see <ref
                        target="#d153-f1">footnote 1, Document 153</ref>.</p>
            </note>
